Author: Qian Zhang [aut, cre](Equal contribution), Chenyu Li [aut，cre](Equal contribution), Liwei Zhang [aut, ths]
Maintainer: Qian Zhang <3136708473@qq.com>
Description: Tools for phase-resolved circadian analysis in heterogeneous
    single-cell transcriptomic data. scRhythmBayes infers latent cell-level
    circadian phase from seed rhythmic genes, estimates gene-level rhythmic
    parameters, and assigns genes to interpretable differential rhythm-state
    modules for condition- and cell-type-resolved circadian remodeling analysis.
